{"seq":1,"slug":"crossshard-join-aggregation-pushdown","title":"跨片 JOIN、聚合与执行计划下推","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/relational-database-sharding-distributed-scaling/crossshard-query-distributed-transaction/crossshard-join-aggregation-pushdown","wordCount":2450,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"跨片-join-聚合与执行计划下推\">跨片 JOIN、聚合与执行计划下推</h1><p>订单表按 <code>buyer_id</code> 分成 32 片之后，买家侧的读写都收敛到单片了，但运营后台一条报表 SQL 卡死了：<code>SELECT seller_id, COUNT(*), AVG(amount) FROM orders JOIN buyers USING(buyer_id) GROUP BY seller_id ORDER BY 2 DESC LIMIT 20</code>。分片键是 <code>buyer_id</code>，查询却按 <code>seller_id</code> 聚合、还要连 <code>buyers</code> 表取画像——32 个分片每个都要被问一遍，结果再拉回中间件拼装。<strong>分片把「一条 SQL」变成了「一次分布式执行计划」，而跨片 JOIN 与聚合的成败，取决于这条计划能把多少计算下推到分片内部、又必须在中间件层留下多少。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-跨片查询的三种形态\">核心概念：跨片查询的三种形态</h2><p>分布式数据库的查询计划不是「能不能做」，而是「在哪一层做」。以 TiDB 为例，<code>EXPLAIN</code> 输出的 <code>task</code> 列直接标出执行位置：<code>cop[tikv]</code> 表示算子被下推到存储层的协处理器执行，<code>root</code> 表示留在计算层（<a href=\"https://docs.pingcap.com/tidb/stable/explain-overview\">TiDB · EXPLAIN Overview</a>）。落在哪一边，决定了一次查询要跨多少次网络。</p>\n<p>按路由收敛度，跨片查询分三类，代价逐级上升：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>形态</th>\n<th>路由结果</th>\n<th>典型触发</th>\n<th>计划层</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>Router（单分片）</strong></td>\n<td>命中 1 片</td>\n<td>WHERE 带分片键等值</td>\n<td>全下推，无中间件参与</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Scatter（广播）</strong></td>\n<td>命中 N 片</td>\n<td>WHERE 不带分片键、跨片聚合</td>\n<td>谓语/投影下推，聚合两段式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>跨片 JOIN</strong></td>\n<td>两表落点不一致</td>\n<td>分片键不同的表相连</td>\n<td>同片 JOIN / 广播 JOIN / 重分布 JOIN</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键判断是<strong>分片键能否提供路由</strong>——这与 <code>../1_sharding-strategy-routing-model/2_routing-layer-sql-parser-hint.md</code> 里的路由层是同一件事：路由层从 SQL 解出分片键的值域，才能决定计划收敛还是发散。Citus 讲得更细：客户端请求全经协调节点，规划器先把计划树「变换成可并行化的交换律与结合律形式」，再切成协调节点侧与「运行在各分片 worker 上的查询片段」（<a href=\"https://docs.citusdata.com/en/stable/develop/reference_processing.html\">Citus · Query Processing</a>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;收到 SQL&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;WHERE 是否含分片键等值&quot;}&#10;    B -- 是 --&gt; C[&quot;Router:改写为单片查询&lt;br/&gt;全计划下推单分片&quot;]&#10;    B -- 否 --&gt; D{&quot;是否涉及两表 JOIN&quot;}&#10;    D -- 否 --&gt; E[&quot;Scatter:谓语/投影下推&lt;br/&gt;两段式聚合回并&quot;]&#10;    D -- 是 --&gt; F{&quot;两表是否 colocated&lt;br/&gt;同一分片键&quot;}&#10;    F -- 是 --&gt; G[&quot;Colocated JOIN:下推各分片&lt;br/&gt;各片本地连&quot;]&#10;    F -- 否 --&gt; H{&quot;小表能否整体广播&quot;}&#10;    H -- 是 --&gt; I[&quot;Broadcast JOIN:小表复制到每片&quot;]&#10;    H -- 否 --&gt; J[&quot;Repartition JOIN:按连接键重分布&lt;br/&gt;或 CTE 拉回协调节点(push-pull)&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"收到 SQL\"] --&gt; B{\"WHERE 是否含分片键等值\"}\n    B -- 是 --&gt; C[\"Router:改写为单片查询&lt;br/&gt;全计划下推单分片\"]\n    B -- 否 --&gt; D{\"是否涉及两表 JOIN\"}\n    D -- 否 --&gt; E[\"Scatter:谓语/投影下推&lt;br/&gt;两段式聚合回并\"]\n    D -- 是 --&gt; F{\"两表是否 colocated&lt;br/&gt;同一分片键\"}\n    F -- 是 --&gt; G[\"Colocated JOIN:下推各分片&lt;br/&gt;各片本地连\"]\n    F -- 否 --&gt; H{\"小表能否整体广播\"}\n    H -- 是 --&gt; I[\"Broadcast JOIN:小表复制到每片\"]\n    H -- 否 --&gt; J[\"Repartition JOIN:按连接键重分布&lt;br/&gt;或 CTE 拉回协调节点(push-pull)\"]</pre><h2 id=\"下推的三层-谓语-聚合与-limit\">下推的三层：谓语、聚合与 LIMIT</h2><p>下推不是一步到底的开关，而是一组按收益递增的能力。谓语与投影下推（把 <code>WHERE</code>、<code>SELECT</code> 的列裁剪推到分片）几乎总是安全的，因为它们逐行独立。真正决定性能的是<strong>聚合下推</strong>与 <strong>LIMIT 下推</strong>，它们各自要求可结合（associative）与可交换的合并语义。聚合按函数分成三档，合并规则完全不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>函数</th>\n<th>分片内计算</th>\n<th>协调节点合并</th>\n<th>能否完全下推</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>SUM</code> / <code>COUNT</code></td>\n<td>部分和 / 部分计数</td>\n<td>求和</td>\n<td>能（代数聚合）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>MIN</code> / <code>MAX</code></td>\n<td>部分极值</td>\n<td>取极值</td>\n<td>能（代数聚合）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>AVG</code></td>\n<td>需转成 <code>SUM, COUNT</code></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">{\\sum s_i}/{\\sum c_i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>能，但必须先改写</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>COUNT(DISTINCT)</code></td>\n<td>各片去重后仍可能重合</td>\n<td>必须再全局去重</td>\n<td>不能，需搬全量或近似</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中位数 / 分位数</td>\n<td>无部分结果</td>\n<td>必须看全量</td>\n<td>不能</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>AVG</code> 是最容易出错的点。分片直接算出的 <code>AVG</code> 不能再平均——平均值不可结合。正确改写是把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>V</mi><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AVG(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 拆成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum x_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 两个部分量，协调节点按加权公式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\">‾</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\overline{x} = \\sum s_i / \\sum n_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord overline\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6306em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.5506em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"overline-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 还原。Citus 的 <code>EXPLAIN</code> 例子正是这个形状：worker 在各 shard 上先做部分 <code>HashAggregate</code>，协调节点收集后再做最终 <code>GroupAggregate</code>，并因 <code>GroupAggregate</code> 要求有序而附带一次协调节点侧排序（<a href=\"https://docs.citusdata.com/en/stable/develop/reference_processing.html\">Citus</a>）。</p>\n<p><code>LIMIT</code> 下推依赖有序性。<code>ORDER BY seller_id LIMIT 20</code> 若要精确，需要每个分片各返回自身的前 20 名（部分 top-K），协调节点做 K 路归并后再砍到 20——全局前 20 名必然落在每片前 20 名之内，所以这是精确的。但 <code>LIMIT</code> 若出现在<strong>子查询内部</strong>，就成了下推屏障：Citus 文档明确说子查询内的 <code>LIMIT</code> 使该子查询无法与主查询片段一起内联执行，必须先独立算完、把中间结果拉到协调节点，再分发回各 worker 供外层使用——Citus 称之为「push-pull」机制（recursive planning）。示例计划里对应 <code>Distributed Subplan 6_1</code> 与 <code>read_intermediate_result</code> 函数扫描，数据来自协调节点拷入的文件（<a href=\"https://docs.citusdata.com/en/stable/develop/reference_processing.html\">Citus</a>）。</p>\n<p>这意味着一个容易踩的坑：<code>WHERE x IN (SELECT id FROM t ORDER BY ts DESC LIMIT 100)</code> 这类写法，在分片环境里会退化成跨节点搬两趟数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨片-join-的四种执行策略\">跨片 JOIN 的四种执行策略</h2><p>两表若分片键不同，JOIN 必须选择一种数据搬运方式。这不是实现细节，而是可以算出来的成本决策。设大表尺寸 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|L|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>、小表尺寸 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|S|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>、节点数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Colocated JOIN（同片连接）</strong>：两表同分片键、同分片函数，连接键又恰是分片键时，匹配行天然同片。搬运量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>，各分片本地完成，是唯一「零跨片」的连接，也是分片设计最该追求的目标。Citus 要求源表与目标表 colocated 且「SELECT 与 INSERT 语句都包含分布列」，才把 <code>INSERT … SELECT</code> 直接下推（<a href=\"https://docs.citusdata.com/en/stable/develop/reference_dml.html\">Citus · DML</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>Broadcast JOIN（广播连接）</strong>：小表被完整复制到每台持有大表的节点。搬运量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\approx |S| \\cdot N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>。适用于维度表、字典表——Citus 的 reference table 专为此设计：参考表在每个节点都有一份完整副本，JOIN 时无需搬运。</li>\n<li><strong>Repartition / Shuffle JOIN（重分布连接）</strong>：两表都按连接键哈希重分布，使匹配行落到同一节点。搬运量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\approx |L| + |S|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>，但要跨网络打散。Citus 的 repartition 路径仅在「SELECT 不需要协调节点合并」时可用，且被 <code>ORDER BY</code>、<code>LIMIT</code>、<code>OFFSET</code>、不含分布列的 <code>GROUP BY</code>、按非分布列分区的窗口函数，以及「非 colocated 表之间的连接」阻断（<a href=\"https://docs.citusdata.com/en/stable/develop/reference_dml.html\">Citus · DML</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>Pull-up（拉回协调节点）</strong>：所有分片结果汇总到协调节点做最终连接。Citus 文档指出这是最慢的路径，因为「所有数据都穿过一个节点」。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>广播与重分布的取舍有明确临界点——小表够小则广播更划算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>N</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo>&lt;</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>选广播</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|S| \\cdot N \\;&lt;\\; |L| + |S| \\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\; \\text{选广播}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">选广播</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>TiDB 的 MPP 模式把同样的选择做成可调阈值：broadcast join 走 <code>Broadcast</code> 交换，shuffle hash join 走 <code>HashPartition</code> 交换，是否广播由 <code>tidb_broadcast_join_threshold_count</code> 与 <code>tidb_broadcast_join_threshold_size</code> 控制——估算的小表行数或字节数低于阈值才广播（<a href=\"https://docs.pingcap.com/tidb/stable/explain-mpp\">TiDB · MPP</a>）。</p>\n<p>MPP 计划里，查询被切成若干 fragment，fragment 之间由 exchange 算子分隔，每个 fragment 的根都是 <code>ExchangeSender</code>，下游用 <code>ExchangeReceiver</code> 读数据。交换类型只有三种，恰好对应上面三种搬运方式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>交换类型</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>对应策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>HashPartition</code></td>\n<td>按 join/group key 哈希分区</td>\n<td>shuffle join、分布式聚合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Broadcast</code></td>\n<td>复制到所有相关节点</td>\n<td>broadcast join</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>PassThrough</code></td>\n<td>汇到单一上游任务</td>\n<td>最终结果回传计算层</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>电商场景的典型分化是：订单表按 <code>buyer_id</code> 分片，商品维表是几百行的 SKU 字典——维表做成 reference table 走广播；而「订单 × 卖家结算明细」两张大表分片键不同，只能重分布，这时就该反问分片键设计是否从一开始就错了。</p>\n<h2 id=\"二级索引与下推的协同\">二级索引与下推的协同</h2><p>跨片查询的另一个瓶颈是二级索引。分片后，非分片键的索引默认是<strong>分片本地索引</strong>——每个分片维护自己那一份，查询 <code>WHERE order_no = ?</code> 时，若中间件不知道 <code>order_no</code> 属于哪片，就要广播到全部分片各查一次本地索引再合并。这与 <code>../1_sharding-strategy-routing-model/1_sharding-key-selection-hotspot-avoidance.md</code> 中的「查询覆盖率」判据是同一个问题：分片键不覆盖的查询列，需要额外的路由结构。</p>\n<p>Vitess 用 <strong>lookup vindex</strong> 解决：一张后备表把 <code>order_no</code> 映射到 keyspace ID，查询先查映射表定位分片，再定向查询。代价被量化为路由成本——Identity 0、Functional 1、Lookup Unique 10、Lookup NonUnique 20，VTGate 挑成本最低的（<a href=\"https://vitess.io/docs/22.0/reference/features/vindexes/\">Vitess · Vindexes</a>）。这解释了为什么「全局二级索引」在分布式数据库里永远是二等问题：不是索引本身慢，而是<strong>索引到分片的映射需要额外一跳</strong>，且这一跳也可能跨片。</p>\n<p>ShardingSphere 把跨片结果合并显式建模成一个 <strong>Merger Engine</strong>，位于 Parse → Route → Rewrite → Execute → Merge 流水线末端，专门负责 <code>ORDER BY</code>、<code>GROUP BY</code>、<code>DISTINCT</code> 与聚合的归并；跨分片 JOIN 则由 <strong>SQL Federation</strong> 执行引擎承担（<a href=\"https://shardingsphere.apache.org/document/current/en/features/\">ShardingSphere · Features</a>）。把「归并」独立成一层是有道理的——归并的语义上限决定了多少计算可以留在分片内。</p>\n<h2 id=\"电商报表场景的落地检查清单\">电商报表场景的落地检查清单</h2><p>回到开头那条卡死的报表 SQL。它同时触发三个退化：按非分片键 <code>seller_id</code> 聚合（全片广播）、跨片 JOIN <code>buyers</code> 维表、<code>ORDER BY … LIMIT</code> 需 K 路归并。优化不是换数据库，而是逐条消除退化：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>维表广播化</strong>：把 <code>buyers</code> 这类小型画像表转成 reference table，每节点一份副本，JOIN 不再跨片。</li>\n<li><strong>聚合改写</strong>：确认 <code>AVG</code> 已拆成 <code>SUM</code>/<code>COUNT</code>，<code>COUNT(DISTINCT)</code> 换成近似（HLL）或提前物化。</li>\n<li><strong>预聚合</strong>：卖家维度的日/小时 GMV 落成按 <code>seller_id</code> 分片的汇总表，把「扫全量订单再聚合」变成「单分片聚合」——用空间换路由收敛。</li>\n<li><strong>异步导出</strong>：报表类查询本不该走在线 OLTP 分片，改用 CDC 订阅到列存/OLAP 引擎，让分析负载与交易负载物理隔离。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>判断标准始终是一条：<strong>这条查询命中了几个分片，又搬了多少字节跨节点</strong>。只要这两个数字能被 <code>EXPLAIN</code> 读出来，跨片查询就是可调优的工程问题，而非必须接受的性能债。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>跨片查询分三种形态：单分片 router、广播 scatter、跨片 JOIN；计划边界由分片键能否路由决定。</li>\n<li>下推分三层：谓语/投影几乎总能下推；聚合需可结合语义（<code>AVG</code> 要改写为 <code>SUM/COUNT</code>）；子查询内的 <code>LIMIT</code> 是下推屏障，会触发 push-pull 两趟搬运。</li>\n<li>跨片 JOIN 有四种策略：colocated（零搬运）、broadcast（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\approx |S| \\cdot N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>）、repartition（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\approx |L|+|S|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>）、pull-up（最慢）。</li>\n<li>TiDB MPP 用 <code>HashPartition</code> / <code>Broadcast</code> / <code>PassThrough</code> 三种 exchange 对应 shuffle join、广播 join 与结果回传，广播阈值由 <code>tidb_broadcast_join_threshold_*</code> 控制。</li>\n<li>二级索引（lookup vindex / 全局二级索引）本质是「索引到分片的额外一跳」；电商报表的根治手段是预聚合 + 维表广播 + 交易/分析负载隔离。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"跨片 JOIN、聚合与执行计划下推","id":"跨片-join-聚合与执行计划下推"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：跨片查询的三种形态","id":"核心概念-跨片查询的三种形态"},{"level":2,"text":"下推的三层：谓语、聚合与 LIMIT","id":"下推的三层-谓语-聚合与-limit"},{"level":2,"text":"跨片 JOIN 的四种执行策略","id":"跨片-join-的四种执行策略"},{"level":2,"text":"二级索引与下推的协同","id":"二级索引与下推的协同"},{"level":2,"text":"电商报表场景的落地检查清单","id":"电商报表场景的落地检查清单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"迁移一致性校验、限流降级与回滚","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/relational-database-sharding-distributed-scaling/rebalancing-consistent-hashing-online-migration/migration-consistency-rollback-throttling"},"next":{"title":"分布式事务：2PC/TCC/Saga 与最终一致性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/relational-database-sharding-distributed-scaling/crossshard-query-distributed-transaction/distributed-transaction-2pc-tcc-saga"}}